#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:104
msgid "Annika Uudelepp is a civil society and governance expert with the Praxis think tank, and has long been spotlighting and helping to address issues of concern in Estonian society."
msgstr ""

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:114
msgid "Henrik Karmo is an investor with a broad set of experiences in building various investment companies and developing investment strategies."
