#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:214
msgid "Kadi Lambot is a doctor who has served as CEO of a number of large enterprises. Kadi believes that the medical system needs comprehensive, user-friendly solutions and works to that end as member of the supervisory board of the Cancer Society, Healthy Estonia Foundation, and Tartu University Foundation."
